<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">RRK47.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 ABAKORINSO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha Y'okubanza Ei Paulo Yaahandiikiire Abakorinso</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Abakorinso</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA Y'OKUBANZA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAKORINSO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Paulo owaayetsirwe kuba entumwa ya Yesu Kristo, nk'oku Ruhanga yaakunzire, na Soseene ow'eishe-emwe, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />twabahandiikira imwe ab'omu kanisa ya Ruhanga eri Korinso, abaayeziibwe omuri Kristo Yesu, bakeetwa kuba abarikwera hamwe na boona abari hoonahoona abatakira eiziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, Mukama waabo kandi owaitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nitubendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusiima ekanisa ya Korinso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Obutoosha nsiima Ruhanga wangye ahabwanyu, nimmusiimira embabazi ze ezi mwahairwe omuri Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />ahabw'okuba omu miringo yoona mukahinduka abatungi omuriwe, omuri byona ebi mugamba kandi n'ebi mumanya, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />nk'okuhamya Kristo kwaitu oku kwahamiibwe omuriimwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:13">Tit 2:13</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo tihariho kiconco kyona eky'Omwoyo eki mutaine, nimutegyereza okushuuruurwa kwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:6">Fil 1:6</ref>. </char></note> niwe aribagumya okuhitsya aha muheru, mukashangwa mutaine ky'okuhanwa aha kiro kya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:3">1 Yoh 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga n'omwesigwa owaabeetsire kutaaha omu kukwatanisa hamwe n'Omwana we Yesu Kristo Mukama waitu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi ky'okwecwamu ebicweka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:2">Fil 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nimbeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, mukaikirizaine, mureka kwebaganisamu, mukwatanisa hamwe buzima omu biteekateeko byanyu n'omu bi murikuhamya. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ahakuba mperize kumanyisibwa ab'owa Keloe ngu mwine empaka, B'eishe-emwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:27">Byak 18:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:4">1 Kor 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Eki ndikugamba nikyo eki ngu, buri omwe omuriimwe naagira ati: Nyowe ndi owa Paulo; kandi ondi ati: Ndi owa Apolo; ondi ati: Ndi owa Keefa; n'ondiijo ati: Ndi owa Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Nimugira ngu Kristo abaganisiibwemu? Paulo akababambirwa? Nari mukabatizibwa omu iziina rya Paulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ninsiima Ruhanga ahabw'okuba tindabatiize muntu omuriimwe, kureka Krispo na Gaayo, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />ahu mwakwekwatsize ngu mukabatizibwa omu iziina ryangye. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Kureka nkabatiza ab'omu ka ya Stefana; tindikwijuka yaaba hariho ondiijo weena ou naabatiize). <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:2">Yoh 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Kristo tarantumire kubatiza, kureka okubuurira engiri, ntarikugigambisa bigambo by'obwengye, ngu omusharaba gwa Kristo gurekye kuhinduka ogwa busha.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku obwengye bwa Ruhanga butaanuukaine n'obw'ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:16">Rom 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ekigambo ky'omusharaba aha barikuhwerekyerera n'obushema, kwonka ahariitwe abarikujunwa n'amaani ga Ruhanga; <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa 29:14</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba kikahandiikwa ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">Ndyacwekyereza obwengye bw'abanyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">N'okwetegyereza kw'abarikwetegyereza ndyakuhindura busha.<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:17">Yob 12:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omunyabwengye arahi? Omuhandiiki arahi? Omunyampaka ow'obusingye obu arahi? Timurikumanya ngu Ruhanga akahindura obwengye bw'ensi obushema? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mat 11:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omu bwengye bwa Ruhanga ku atarasiimire obwengye bw'ensi kuba nibwo bwareetera abantu kumumanya, yaasiima kujuna abarikwikiriza, naabajunisa obushema bw'okubuurira kwaitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:48">Yoh 4:48</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya bashaba obumanyiso, n'Abagriika basherura obwengye, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:14">1 Kor 2:14</ref>. </char></note> kwonka itwe tubuurira Kristo owaabambirwe aha musharaba; kandi ogwo aha Bayudaaya n'enkongi, n'aha Banyamahanga n'obushema, <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />kwonka ahari abo abarikwetwa Abayudaaya n'Abagriika, ni Kristo, amaani ga Ruhanga kandi obwengye bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:4">2 Kor 13:4</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu obushema bwa Ruhanga n'obw'obwengye okukira obwengye bw'abantu, kandi n'obweremwa bwa Ruhanga n'obw'amaani okukira amaani g'abantu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:48">Yoh 7:48</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:1-5">Yak 2:1-5</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, mwetegyereze okwetwa kwanyu; abaine obwengye bw'ensi egi omuriimwe ti baingi, n'obu baakuba abakama, n'obu baakuba ab'ekitiinisa; <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />kwonka Ruhanga akatoorana abashema b'ensi ngu akwatse enshoni abanyabwengye; kandi Ruhanga akatoorana ebitaine maani ngu akwatse enshoni ebiine amaani; <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />n'eby'ahansi eby'ensi n'ebirikugaywa Ruhanga akabitoorana, kandi n'ebitariho, abone kuhindura busha ebiriho, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:27">Rom 3:27</ref>. </char></note> ngu hatakaagira omuntu weena owaayehimbisa omu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ahabwe muri omuri Kristo Yesu, ou Ruhanga yaahindwire obwengye bwaitu, n'okuhikiirira, n'okwera, n'obucunguzi; <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Yer 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="JER 9:24">24</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo orikwehimbisa, ayehimbise ahabwa Mukama, nk'oku kihandiikirwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Amaani g'engiri ni Yesu Kristo owaabambirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:17">1 Kor 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, obu naija owaanyu, tindaizire nimbagambira enaama ya Ruhanga nk'omugambi murungi nari omunyabwengye; <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:14">Gal 6:14</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba nkamariirira kutagira kindi kyona eki naamanya omuriimwe, kureka Yesu Kristo, ogwo owaabambirwe. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:1">2 Kor 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Nkaba ntuura naimwe, nyine obweremwa, n'obwoba bwingi, nintetema. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Emigambire yangye n'obutumwa bwangye bikaba bitari bigambo by'obwengye eby'okwikiririsa abantu, kureka eby'okubooreka Omwoyo n'amaani, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:5">1 Tes 1:5</ref>. </char></note> ngu okwikiriza kwanyu kuteegamira obwengye bw'abantu kureka amaani ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Kwonka obwengye tubugamba n'abo abahikiriire, kwonka buba butari bwa nsi egi, n'obu bwakuba obw'abategyeki b'ensi egi ab'okuhwaho. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Itwe tugamba obwengye bwa Ruhanga, obwasherekirwe omu naama, ei Ruhanga yaataireho, ensi zoona zitakahangirwe, okutuhaisa ekitiinisa. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Tihariho n'omwe omu bategyeki b'ensi egi owaabumanyire; ahakuba, kuri baabumanyire, tibaakubambire Mukama ow'ekitiinisa; <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa 64:4</ref>. </char></note> kwonka nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Ebi eriisho ritakareebaga, n'okutu ebi kutakahuriraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Ebitakataahaga mu mutima gw'omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">Byona ebi Ruhanga yaacumiire abamukunda,<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ruhanga akabitushuuruurira, naabitumanyisisa Omwoyo we; ahabw'okuba arondoora byona, nangwa n'ebitarikumanywa bya Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />N'oha omu bantu orikumanya ebi omuntu ateekateeka, kureka omwoyo ogu omuntu aine. Na mbwenu tihariho orikumanya ebya Ruhanga kureka Omwoyo wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:13">Yoh 16:13</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 16:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi itwe omwoyo ou twahairwe ti w'ensi egi, kureka n'Omwoyo oruga ahari Ruhanga, ngu tubone kwetegyereza ebi Ruhanga atuheera busha. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Nibyo tugamba, tutarikubigambisa bigambo ebyegyesibwa n'obwengye bw'abantu, kureka ebyegyesiibwe Omwoyo, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: nitushoboorora eby'omwoyo, tubishobooroza ebindi by'Omwoyo. </char></note>nitushobororera abaine Omwoyo eby'Omwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:17">Yoh 14:17</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ow'obuzaarwa bw'obuntu taikiriza by'Omwoyo wa Ruhanga, ahabw'okuba bimubeera eby'obushema, kandi tabaasa kubyetegyereza, ahakuba byetegyerezibwa omu buryo bw'Omwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:20">1 Yoh 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Ow'Omwoyo ayetegyereza byona, kwonka we tayetegyerezibwa muntu weena. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref>. </char></note> N'oha oramanyire ebi Mukama ateekateeka, haza akaija kumwegyesa? Kwonka itwe twine okuteekateeka kwa Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ab'Omwoyo n'ab'obuzaarwa bw'obuntu oku bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:12">Yoh 16:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka, B'eishe-emwe, tindabaasize kubagambira nk'ab'Omwoyo, kureka nk'ab'omubiri, nk'abeereere omuri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12">Heb 5:12</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 5:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Nkabagaburira amate, tindabahaire by'okurya bigumire; ahabw'okuba mukaba mutakabibaasize. Kandi na hati hoona timukabibaasize, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-12">1 Kor 1:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:18">11:18</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba mukiri ab'omu mubiri kwonka. Omuriimwe ku haraabe harimu eihari n'empaka, timuri omu buryo bw'omubiri, abarikutwaza nk'abantu-buntu? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Omwe ku araabe naagira ati, Nyowe ndi owa Paulo; n'ondiijo ati, Nyowe ndi owa Apolo, obwo nimuba mutari abantu-buntu?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Mbwenu Apolo n'enki? Nari Paulo n'enki? N'abakozi abaabaikiririise, nka buri omwe oku Mukama yaamuhaire. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:11">Byak 18:11</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe nkabyara, Apolo yaitirira amaizi, kwonka Ruhanga niwe yaabikurize. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo orikubyara ti kintu, n'obu yaakuba orikwitirira amaizi, kureka Ruhanga okuza. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Orikubyara n'orikwitirira amaizi nibaingana, kandi buri omwe aryaheebwa ebihembo nk'omurimo gwe oku guriba guri; <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:3-9">Mat 13:3-9</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba turi abakozi abakora kumwe, nitukorera Ruhanga; imwe muri omusiri gwa Ruhanga, n'enju erikwombekwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:15">2 Pet 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'embabazi za Ruhanga ezi naahairwe oku ziri, nyowe nkombeka omusingi nka mukama w'abombeki ow'obwengye; ondiijo yaagwobekyeraho. Kwonka omuntu weena ayerinde oku arikugwombekyeraho. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:4-6">1 Pet 2:4-6</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu tihariho gundi musingi ogu omuntu weena yaakubaasa kutaho, kureka ogwo ogwatairweho, niwe Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Omuntu weena ku ayombeka aha musingi ogu n'ezaabu, n'efeeza, n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi, n'emiganda, n'obunyaatsi n'ebikonko, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:5">1 Kor 4:5</ref>. </char></note> omurimo gw'omuntu weena guryamanyisibwa; ahakuba Ekiro ekyo kiryagworeka, ahabw'okuba guryashuuruurwa omuriro; kandi omuriro nigwo gurihamya omurimo gw'omuntu weena oku guri. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Omurimo ogu omuntu weena yaayombekire aha musingi ogu, ku gurigumaho, aryaheebwa ebihembo. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Kandi omurimo gw'omuntu weena ku gurisya, aryafeerwa; kwonka we wenka aryajunwa, kwonka nk'orabire omu muriro.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakristaayo okuba hekalu ya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 Kor 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Timurikumanya ku muri hekalu ya Ruhanga, kandi n'Omwoyo wa Ruhanga ku atuura omuriimwe? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Omuntu weena ku arihwerekyereza hekalu ya Ruhanga, nawe Ruhanga aryamuhwerekyereza, ahakuba hekalu ya Ruhanga n'erikwera, kandi hekalu egyo niimwe.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 3:17">Kush 3:17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 3:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena arekye kwebeiha. Omuriimwe ku haraabe harimu orikweteekateeka kuba ow'obwengye bw'obusingye obu, ahindukye omushema, abone kuba ow'obwengye. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Yob 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba obwengye bw'ensi egi n'obushema ahari Ruhanga; nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 3:19">Akwatira abanyabwengye omu bugobya bwabo.<verse eid="1CO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Kandi ngu: Mukama naamanya ebiteekateeko by'abanyabwengye ku biba busha. <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu weena arekye kwehimbisa ahabw'abantu; ahakuba byona n'ebyanyu, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />yaaba Paulo, yaaba Apolo, yaaba Keefa, nari ensi, nari amagara, nari rufu, nari ebiriho, nari ebiribaho; byona n'ebyanyu; <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />naimwe muri aba Kristo, na Kristo n'owa Ruhanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Oku nikwo omuntu weena ashemereire kututeekateekaho, ku turi abaheereza ba Kristo n'ababiiki b'enaama za Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:42">Luk 12:42</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buzima ekyetengwa aha babiiki n'okuba abeesigwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Kwonka orubanja oru muncwera, nari oru ncwerwa abandi bantu, ahariinye n'akantu kakye munonga; kandi naanye nyenka tiinyine ru nyecwera. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mumanye ngu tiinyine ki ndikwemanyaho; kwonka ekyo tikyo kiinyihaho rubanja, kureka Mukama niwe ancwera orubanja. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:8">1 Kor 3:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mutaricwa orubanja rw'ekintu kyona, obunaku butakahikire, okuhitsya obu Mukama waitu ariija; niwe arimurika ebyasherekirwe omu mwirima, akooreka enaama ez'omu mitima. Obwo omuntu weena Ruhanga aryamusiima, nk'oku ashemereire.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obusaasi bw'entumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:3">Rom 12:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu B'eishe-emwe, ebi naabyegambaho na Apolo ahabwanyu, nk'orikubacwera enfumu, ngu mutwegyereho okutarenga ha Byahandiikirwe, hatagira n'omwe omuriimwe owaayehimbisa ahabw'omuntu omwe okukira ondiijo. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Beitu n'oha orikukuhindura ow'omutaano aha bandi? Kandi oine ki eki otarahairwe? Mbwenu ku oraabe waakihairwe, ahabw'enki oyehimbisa nk'otarakihairwe?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Muherize kwiguta; muherize kutunga; muhindukire nk'abagabe ahu tutari; ku mwakuhinduka abagabe, tukaashemererwa, nangwa naitwe tutegyeka hamwe naimwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:33">Heb 10:33</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ninteekateeka ngu: Itwe entumwa, Ruhanga akatumurika aha muheru gw'abandi boona, nk'abacwereirwe orubanja rw'okufa; ahakuba tuhindukire ab'okushungwa ensi na baamaraika n'abantu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Itwe turi abashema ahabwa Kristo, kwonka imwe muri abanyabwengye omuri Kristo. Itwe turi abeeremwa, kwonka imwe muri ab'amaani. Imwe muri ab'ekitiinisa, kwonka itwe turi abarikugaywa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:23-27">2 Kor 11:23-27</ref>. </char></note> Na hati hoona twine enjara n'eiriho, tujwaire busha, nituterwa entomi, titwine maka, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:9">1 Tes 2:9</ref>. </char></note> nitufa kubi, nitukora emirimo n'emikono yaitu. Ku batukyeena, tubashabira omugisha; ku batuhiiga, tugumisiriza; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />ku tubeihererwa, tugarukamu gye; tuhindwirwe ekumbwe omu nsi, nk'ebiragazibwa aha bintu byona, n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Ebi tinaabihandiika kubakwatsa enshoni, kureka okubahuguura nk'abaana bangye abarikukundwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:19">Gal 4:19</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba n'obu muraabe mwine ababahabura kakumi omuri Kristo, kwonka timwine baashoimwe baingi; nimumanya ngu niinye naabazaire omuri Kristo Yesu ahabw'engiri. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1 Kor 11:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo nimbeeshengyereza kukuratira emitwarize yangye. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:20">Fil 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo naatumira Timoseo ahariimwe, niwe mwana wangye omuri Mukama, ou ndikukunda, omwesigwa; aryabaijutsya emitwarize yangye ey'omuri Kristo, nk'oku nyegyesa hoonahoona omu makanisa goona. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Abamwe nibeehimbisa, nibagira ngu tindiija waanyu. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Kwonka ndyaija owaanyu juba, Mukama ku arikunda; obwo nibwo ndimanya amaani g'abo abarikwehimbisa, bitari bigambo byabo byonka. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:4">1 Kor 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba obukama bwa Ruhanga tiburi mu kigambo bugambo, kureka omu maani. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nimwenda ki? Nyije n'enkoni, nari omu kukunda n'omu mwoyo gw'obucureezi?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Obuhabe bw'Abakorinso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:7">Lev 18:7</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enkuru ebugire hoona ngu omuriimwe harimu obushambani, kandi obushambani obutarikushangwa n'omu Banyamahanga, omuntu okuraara na muka ishe. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Kandi nimwehimbisa! Timushemereire kushaasha, mukaiha omuriimwe ogwo okozire ekyo? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:5">Kol 2:5</ref>. </char></note> N'obu ndaabe ntari naimwe omu mubiri, kwonka ndi naimwe omu mwoyo; nk'ori naimwe buzima, omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu mperize kucwa orubanja rw'omuntu ogwo okozire ekibi ekyo. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mat 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:10">2 Kor 13:10</ref>. </char></note> Ku muriba muteeraine, naanye ndi hamwe naimwe omu mwoyo n'amaani ga Mukama waitu Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1 Tim 1:20</ref>. </char></note> mushemereire kuhayo omuntu ogwo ahari Sitaane, ahwerekyerere omu mubiri, omwoyo gwe gubone kujunwa aha kiro kya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Okwehimbisa kwanyu ti kurungi. Timurikumanya ngu akatumbisa kakye katumbisa ekiihuro kyona? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:19">1 Pet 1:19</ref>. </char></note> Mwihemu ekitumbisa ekya ira, mubone kuba ekiihuro kisya, mutarimu kitumbisa. Ahakuba Kristo Omwana gw'entaama ogw'Okuhingurwaho kwaitu akatambwa ahabwaitu. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:3-20">Kur 12:3-20</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ka tugume turinde ekiro ky'Obugyenyi obwo, tutaine kitumbisa ekya ira n'obu kyakuba eky'eitima n'obubi, kureka omugaati ogutarimu kitumbisa ogushemeire, kandi ogw'amazima.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Omu baruha ei naabahandiikiire nkabaragiira kutakwatanisa na bashambani; <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />kwonka tindagambire kutaanira kimwe n'abashambani b'ensi egi, nari abeetengi, nari abambuzi, nari abarikuramya ebishushani; ahabw'okuba ku kyakubaire kityo, mukaabaire mushemereire kuruga omu nsi. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Tes 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:10">2 Yoh 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eki naabahandiikiire, n'okutakwatanisa na muntu orikwetwa ow'eishe-emwe, ku araabe ari omushambani, nari omwetengi, nari orikuramya ebishushani, nari omujumi, nari omusinzi, nari omwambuzi; orikushusha atyo, n'okurya mutarirya nawe. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Nyowe ninfa ki okucwera ab'aheeru orubanja? Ab'omu kanisa ti bo mushemereire kucwera orubanja? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Kwonka ab'aheeru Ruhanga niwe arirubacwera. Mwihe omuriimwe omuntu ogwo omubi.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abakristaayo okutatabaarizana mu maramuriro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Omuntu weena omuriimwe, ku araabe aine eki arikufa na mutaahi we, tikirikumukwatsa enshoni kumutabaariza omu maisho g'abatahikiriire, omu mwanya gw'okumutabaariza omu maisho g'abarikwera? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:22">Dan 7:22</ref>. </char></note> Timurikumanya ngu abarikwera nibo baricwera ensi orubanja? Kandi ku muraabe niimwe muricwera ensi orubanja, timurikubaasa kucwa emanja nkye nk'ezo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Timurikumanya ku turicwera baamaraika emanja? Reero kaashwa eby'amagara aga? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Mbwenu shi, ku muraabe nimugira emanja nk'ezo, ahabw'enki mutoorana abarikugaywa ekanisa kuba nibo baazicwa? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ebi naabigamba kubakwatsa enshoni. Omuriimwe tiharimu n'omwe oine obwengye owaakubaasa kucwera beene ishe orubanja? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ahakuba ab'eishe-emwe nibatabaariza ab'eishe-emwe abandi, kandi batabaarizana aha batarikwikiriza!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:15">1 Tes 5:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu muherize kureebwaho ekishobyo buzima, ahabw'okutongatongana mwenka. Ahabw'enki mutarikufa kwemera okukorwa kubi? Ahabw'enki mutaikiriza kugobezibwa mukafeerwa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Mbwenu omu mwanya gw'ebyo niimwe mukora kubi abandi, mukabagobeza, kandi abu mugobeza n'abeishe-emwe.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Timurikumanya ngu abatahikiriire tibarihungura bukama bwa Ruhanga? Mutaribeihwa; abashambani, nari abarikuramya ebishushani, nari abeegira abakazi, nari ebitingwa, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:19-21">Gal 5:19-21</ref>. </char></note> nari abashuma, nari abeetengi, nari abasinzi, nari abajumi, n'obu baakuba abanyagi, abo boona tibarihungura bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:3-7">Tit 3:3-7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bamwe omuriimwe mukaba muri nka bo; kwonka mukoogibwa, mwayezibwa, mwaihwaho orubanja omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'omu Mwoyo wa Ruhanga.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emibiri yaitu okuba engingo za Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Byona nimbiikirizibwa, kwonka ti byona ebirikungasira. Byona nimbiikirizibwa, kwonka tinditegyekwa kintu kyona. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:3-5">1 Tes 4:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Eby'okurya n'eby'enda, kandi enda nayo n'ey'eby'okurya; kwonka Ruhanga aryabiihaho byombi. Omubiri tigurahangiirwe bushambani, kureka gukahangirwa Mukama waitu, na Mukama waitu niwe Mukama w'omubiri; <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:11">Rom 8:11</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ruhanga akazoora Mukama waitu, naitwe aryatuzoora n'amaani ge. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Timurikumanya ngu emibiri yaanyu eba engingo za Kristo? Mbwenu nimbaasa nta kutwara engingo za Kristo, nkazihindura engingo za maraaya? Rubuuza! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Nari shi, timurikumanya ngu orikuteerana na maraaya nibaba omubiri gumwe? Ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: Abo bombi baryaba omubiri gumwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:30">Efe 5:30</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka oteeraine na Mukama nibaba omwoyo gumwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Mwetantare obushambani. Ekibi ekindi kyona eki omuntu akora kiba aheeru y'omubiri gwe; kwonka orikushambana naaba akozire ekibi ky'okushiisha omubiri gwe wenka. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Timurikumanya ngu omubiri gwanyu niyo hekalu y'Omwoyo Orikwera ori omuriimwe, ou mwahairwe Ruhanga? Imwe timurikwetegyeka; <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:18">1 Pet 1:18</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 1:19">19</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba mukagurwa n'obuguzi bwingi. N'ahabw'ekyo muhaise Ruhanga ekitiinisa omu mibiri yaanyu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'obushwere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Ebirikukwata aha bi mwampandiikiire, ekirungi n'omushaija kutakora ha mukazi. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Kwonka ahabw'okwerinda obushambani, omushaija weena agire omukazi we; kandi omukazi weena agire omushaija we. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Omushaija ahe omukazi we ekimushemereire, kandi omukazi nawe ahe iba ekimushemereire. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ahakuba omukazi tategyeka mubiri gwe, kureka gutegyekwa iba; kandi n'omushaija tategyeka mubiri gwe, kureka gutegyekwa omukazi we. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Murekye kwimana, kureka mwaba muragaine omwanya, ngu mubone kwehayo omu kushaba, bwanyima mugarukye kuba hamwe, Sitaane arekye kubategyesa okuteezibira kwanyu. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ebi naabigamba kubaha obusingye, ti kiragiro ngu nimbaragiira; <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:12">Mat 19:12</ref>. </char></note> kureka nkaayenzire abantu boona kuba nkaanye. Kwonka omuntu weena aine ekiconco kye eki yaahairwe Ruhanga, omwe okwe, n'ondiijo okwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Kwonka abatakashweire, n'abatakashweirwe, n'abafaakazi nimbagambira nti: Ekyakubaire kirungi aharibo n'okuba nkaanye. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:14">1 Tim 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku baraabe batarikubaasa kwezibira, bashwere, nari bashwerwe; ahakuba haakiri okushwera nari okushwerwa okukira okubuguma. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kandi abashweire n'abashweirwe nimbaragiira, kwonka tiinye kureka Mukama waitu, omukazi arekye kutaana na iba; <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />kandi ku araabe yaataine nawe, agumire aho atashwerwa ondiijo, nari shi agarukane na iba, kandi omushaija atarishenda omukazi we. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Abandi niinye ndikubagambira, ti Mukama nti: Ow'eishe-emwe weena, ku araabe aine omukazi otarikwikiriza, omukazi ogwo yaakunda kuguma nawe, arekye kumushenda. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Kandi omukazi weena, oine iba otarikwikiriza, iba yaakunda kuguma nawe, omukazi ogwo ataritaana n'omushaija we. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ahakuba omushaija otarikwikiriza ayezibwa ahabw'omukazi we; n'omukazi otarikwikiriza ayezibwa ahabw'ow'eishe-emwe ogwo. Kuri kitari kityo, abaana baanyu bakaabaire abatashemeziibwe, kwonka hati n'abarikwera. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Kwonka otarikwikiriza, ku araabe naayenda kutaana, ataane. Ku birikuba bityo, ow'eishe-emwe omushaija nari omukazi naaba atakibohwa. Ahakuba Ruhanga akatwetera obusingye. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Iwe mukazi 'we, noomanya ota ku otarijuna baro? Nari shi, iwe mushaija 'we, noomanya ota ku otarijuna mukazi waawe?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Kwonka, nk'oku Mukama waitu yaahaire omuntu weena, kandi nk'oku Ruhanga yaayetsire buri muntu, abe nikwo yaatwaza. Naanye nikwo ndagiire omu makanisa goona. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Hariho omuntu owaayetsirwe ashazirwe? Arekye kuhinduka nk'otashazirwe. Nari shi hariho owaayetsirwe atashazirwe? Arekye kusharwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:25">Rom 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Okusharwa tikwine mugasho, n'obu kwakuba okutasharwa, kureka okworobera ebiragiro bya Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Omuntu weena agume nk'oku yaabaire ari, obu yaayetwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Okeetwa ori omuhuuku? Kirekye kukusaasa; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: Kwonka ku oraabe noobaasa kuburugamu, oburugyemu. </char></note>kandi n'obu waakuba noobaasa kuburugamu, haakiri obugumemu. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:6">Efe 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu owaayetsirwe omuri Mukama ari omuhuuku, aheebwa obusingye Mukama; kandi n'ogwo owaayetsirwe aine obusingye, aba omuhuuku wa kristo. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mukagurwa obuguzi bwingi; murekye kuhinduka abahuuku b'abantu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, omuntu weena agume omuri Ruhanga ari nk'oku yaabaire ari, obu yaayetwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Eby'abatakashweire n'abatakashweirwe, tiinyine kiragiro kya Mukama aharibyo. Kwonka ningamba eki ndikubiteekateekaho, nk'omuntu omwesigwa ahabw'embabazi za Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Kandi ninteekateeka ngu, ahabw'obusaasi oburiho omu biro ebi, ni kirungi buri muntu okuguma nk'oku ari. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Okateeranwa n'omukazi? Oteetenga kutaanisibwa. Okataanisibwa n'omukazi? Otashwera ondiijo. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:23">Luk 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku oraashwere, nooba otasiisire; n'omwishiki ku araashwerwe, naaba atasiisire. Kwonka abarikushwerana baryagira obusaasi omu mubiri; kandi eki naakwenzire n'okububakiza. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:11">Rom 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo nikyo ndikugambira nti: B'eishe-emwe, hatsigaire ebiro bikye; okuruga hati abaine abakazi babe nk'abatabaine; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />abarikurira babe nk'abatarikurira; abarikushemererwa babe nk'abatarikushemererwa; abarikugura babe nk'abataine ki baine; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:15-17">1 Yoh 2:15-17</ref>. </char></note> n'abarikukoresa eby'ensi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: barekye kubikoresa kubi. </char></note>barekye kurengyesereza, ahabw'okuba omuhango gw'ensi egi niguhwaho.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Niinyenda ngu muteemereza omutima. Otaine mukazi ota omutima aha bya Mukama oku araagwise gye Mukama; <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:20">Luk 14:20</ref>. </char></note> kwonka oine omukazi ata omutima aha by'ensi, oku araagwise gye omukazi we. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Kandi hariho omutaano gw'oine omushaija, n'otamwine. Otaine mushaija ata omutima aha bya Mukama, ngu abone kuguma ayeziibwe omu mubiri n'omu mwoyo; kwonka oine omushaija ata omutima aha by'ensi, oku araagwise gye iba. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ebyo naabigamba ahabw'okubahwera, ti kubatega mutego, kureka kubooreka ebishemeire, ngu mubone kukorera Mukama mutaine mitima ebiri. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Omuntu weena ku araateekateekye ngu tarikukora gye mwishiki ou arikugamba obugyenyi, kandi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: yaaba ahikire kushwerwa. </char></note>atarikubaasa kutegyeka mubiri gwe, akore eki arikusiima, ku kiraabe kiri kityo; amushwere; naaba atasiisire. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Kwonka ohamire omu mutima gwe, otaine kirikumugyema, kandi orikubaasa kutegyeka omubiri gwe, akamariirira kumureka akaguma ari omwishiki, naaba akozire gye. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />N'ahabw'ekyo orikushwera omwishiki ou arikugamba obugyenyi, naaba akozire gye; kwonka orikureka kumushwera, naaba amweshumbize kukora gye.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:2">Rom 7:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omukazi akwatwa iba, yaaba akiriho; kwonka iba ku afa, aba aine obusingye okushwerwa ou arikwenda, kwonka omuri Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Kwonka ku yaakuguma aho nk'oku ari, obwo nibwo yaakukiraho kuba gye, nyowe nikwo ndikuteekateeka; kandi ningira ngu nyine Omwoyo wa Ruhanga.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Empaka z'okurya ebitambiirwe ebishushani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:29">Byak 15:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikukwata aha bitambiirwe ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, nitumanya ngu twena twine obwengye. Obwengye bureeta okwetunguura, kwonka okukunda kwo kwombeka. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:3">Gal 6:3</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku ateekateeka ngu aine eki arikumanya, aba atakakimanyire, nk'oku ashemereire kukimanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Kwonka omuntu ku akunda Ruhanga, niwe amanywa Ruhanga.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:19">1 Kor 10:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu, aha by'okurya ebitambiirwe ebishushani, nitumanya ngu ekishushani kyona omu nsi ni busha, kandi ngu tihariho Ruhanga ondiijo, kureka omwe wenka. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />N'obu haraabe hariho abarikwetwa baaruhanga, ahaiguru n'ahansi, nk'oku hariho baaruhanga baingi n'abakama baingi; <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ahariitwe hariho Ruhanga omwe Isheboona, ou ebintu byona bikomookaho, naitwe turi abahuriire ahabw'okuba abe; kandi hariho Mukama omwe, niwe Yesu Kristo, obaisaho ebintu byona, naitwe akatubaisaho.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Kwonka okwetegyereza oku tikuri mu bantu boona. Abandi ahabw'okumanyiira kukorera ebishushani, n'okuhitsya hati ku barya enyama z'ebibitambiirwe, bateekateeka ngu abu babitambiire ni baaruhanga buzima, emitima yaabo etahamire esiisikara. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:17">Rom 14:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eby'okurya tibyo bitusiimisa ahari Ruhanga. Ku tuba tutabiriire, tihariho ki tufeerwa; kandi ku tubirya, titwine ki twongyerwaho. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:13">Gal 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mwerinde, obundi obusingye bwanyu obu butakaateeza abatahamire entsibo. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Mbwenu omuntu, ku yaakukureeba, ori omuntu oyetegyereize, oshutami nooriira omuri hekalu y'ekishushani ekirikuramibwa, yaaba ataine maani, omutima gwe tigukaatiinuuka, akarya ebitambiirwe ebishushani ebirikuramibwa? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:15">Rom 14:15</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ogwo otaine maani naahwerekyerera naazira okwetegyereza kwawe, kandi ari ow'eishe-emwe ou Kristo yaafeereire. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ku mukora ekibi aha b'eishe-emwe, mwahutaaza emitima yaabo etahamire, muba mukozire ekibi ahari Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />N'ahabw'ekyo eby'okurya ku biraabe nibigwisa ow'eishe-emwe, tindirya nyama ebiro byona, ngu ndekye kugwisa ow'eishe-emwe.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Obusingye bw'abaheereza ba Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:16">Byak 26:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindi ow'obusingye? Tindi entumwa? Tindareebire Yesu Mukama waitu? Timuri omurimo gwangye omuri Mukama? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:2">2 Kor 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 3:3">3</ref>. </char></note> N'obu ndaabe ntari ntumwa aha bandi, kwonka ahariimwe ndi entumwa; ahabw'okuba imwe muri akamanyiso omuri Mukama k'okuhamya ku ndi entumwa buzima. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Eki nikyo ndikwetonganira ahari abo abarikumpakanisa. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Titurikwikirizibwa kuheebwa eby'okurya n'eby'okunywa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Titurikwikirizibwa kutwara abakazi baitu, baaba bari ab'eishe-emwe, n'okugyenda nabo, nk'entumwa ezindi, n'abarumuna ba Mukama waitu, na Keefa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Nari nyowe na Barunaba niitwe twenka abatarikwikirizibwa kureka kukora eby'okwehwera? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Ni muserukare ki oza aha rugamba, haza akeegurira eby'okukoresa? N'oha obyara omusiri gw'emizaabibu, atarye ha bijuma byayo? N'oha oriisa amasyo atanywe mate gaago? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Ebi nimbigamba nk'oku abantu bagamba? Nari Ebiragiro byo tikwo bigamba? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Bir 25:4</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku kyahandiikirwe omu biragiro bya Musa ngu: Otariboha akanwa k'ente, yaaba neejunga oburo. Noogira ngu ente nizo Ruhanga asaasibwa zonka? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Nari shi tarakigambire buzima ahabwaitu? Eego, kikahandiikwa ahabwaitu, ahabw'okuba omuhingi ashemereire kuhinga aine amatsiko; kandi omuhuuzi ashemereire kuhuura aine amatsiko g'okutwara aha bi yaahuura. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Rom 15:27</ref>. </char></note> Itwe ku turaabe twababibiremu eby'Omwoyo, nimugira ngu nikiremeera munonga kubagyeshamu eby'okuhwera omubiri? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Kor 11:9</ref>. </char></note> Abandi ku baraabe baine obwo bushoboorozi ahariimwe, reero kaashwa itwe? Kwonka itwe titurakoreise bushoboorozi obu; kureka tukeemera byona, ngu turekye kuzibira engiri ya Ruhanga kubuga. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:31">Kub 18:31</ref>. </char></note> Timurikumanya ngu abakora emirimo y'omuri hekalu, batungwa ebya hekalu? N'abaheereza aha itambiro, batunga omugabo aha birikutambwaho? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:6">Gal 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Na Mukama waitu nikwo yaaragiire ati: Ababuurizi b'engiri batungwe engiri. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Kwonka nyowe ahari ebyo tindakoreiseho na kimwe; kandi tinaahandiika ebi ngu mbone kukorerwa ntyo; ahakuba haakiri nyowe okufa, okukira omuntu weena kuhindura busha okwehimbisa kwangye oku. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:9">Yer 20:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndaabe nimbuurira engiri, tiinyine ki ndikwehimbisizaho, ahabw'okuba nimbuurira ngyemesereziibwe; kandi ku naakuba ntabuuriire engiri, nkaareeba enaku. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ahakuba ku ndaabe nimbuurira engiri nyeyendeire, nyine ebihembo; kwonka ku ndaabe ningibuurira ngyemirwe, na mbwenu nshemereire kubuurira ahabw'okukwatsibwa engiri egyo. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Mbwenu ebihembo byangye niki? Nibyo ebi ngu, ku ndaabe nimbuurira engiri, ngibuurire ahabw'embabazi, ndekye kukoresa obushoboorozi bwangye bwona obu nyine omu murimo gw'engiri.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuringo gw'okuheereza Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20:26</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu ndaabe ntarikutegyekwa muntu weena, nkeehindura omuhuuku wa boona, ngu nkireho kubona baingi. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:20-26">Byak 21:20-26</ref>. </char></note> Aha Bayudaaya nkatwaza nk'Omuyudaaya, ngu mbone Abayudaaya; aha barikutegyekwa Ebiragiro nkatwaza nk'orikutegyekwa Ebiragiro, (n'obu biraabe bitarikuntegyeka) ngu mbone abarikutegyekwa Ebiragiro; <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />n'aha bataine Biragiro, nkaba nk'otabiine, ngu mbone abataine Biragiro; (ti nk'otaine biragiro ahari Ruhanga, kureka nk'orikutegyekwa ebiragiro bya Kristo). <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:29">2 Kor 11:29</ref>. </char></note> Aha bataine maani, nkahinduka otaine maani, ngu mbone kutunga abataine maani. Ahari boona mpindukire byona, ngu omu miringo yoona mbone kukiza bamwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Kandi ebyo byona mbikora ahabw'engiri, ngu ntungye aha migisha yaayo.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:14">Fil 3:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Timurikumanya ngu omu mpaka z'okwiruka boona bairuka, kwonka oheebwa ebihembo aba omwe? Naimwe mube nikwo mwairuka, mubone kuheebwa ekihembo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:5">2 Tim 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:12">Yak 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu oyezirika omu mizaano egyo ayerinda omuri byona. Kandi abo babikora ahabw'okuheebwa ekirunga ekirikusiisikara, kwonka itwe ahabw'ekitarikusiisikara. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Nikyo nyirukira ntyo, ti nk'otarikumanya i arikuza; nteera entomi, ti nk'orikuteera busha; <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:13">Rom 8:13</ref>. </char></note> kureka nteera omubiri gwangye ogu ngutegyekye, bwanyima ku ndiheza kubuurira abandi, nyowe ahabwangye ntarishangwa ndi otarikwikirizibwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okuba eky'okureeberaho ekirikutuhuguura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:22">Kur 14:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, tindikwenda ngu mutamanya oku baatatenkuriitwe boona baabaire ahansi y'Ekicu, kandi boona ku baarabire omu Nyanja; <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />kandi boona ku baabatiziibwe omu Kicu n'omu Nyanja okukwatanisa na Musa; <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Kur 16:35</ref>. </char></note> kandi boona ku baariire eky'okurya kimwe eky'Omwoyo, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Kur 17:6</ref>. </char></note> boona bakanywa eky'okunywa kimwe eky'Omwoyo; ahakuba bakaba banywa aha rukiri orw'Omwoyo orwabaire rubakurata. Orukiri orwo akaba ari Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Kwonka abarikukira obwingi omuribo Ruhanga tarabasiimire, ahakuba bakahwerekyererezibwa omu ihamba.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:4">Kub 11:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo bikaba eby'okutuhabura, ngu turekye kwetenga ebibi nk'oku baabyetengire. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Kur 32:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi murekye kuba abarikuramya ebishushani, nka bamwe omuribo oku baabaire bari, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Abantu bakashutama ahansi kurya n'okunywa, baimuka kuzina. <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Kub 25:1</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 25:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tutashambana, nka bamwe omuribo oku baashambaine, hakafa abantu obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ishatu eizooba rimwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5">Kub 21:5</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Turekye kugyeza Mukama, nka bamwe omuribo oku baamugyerize, bakamarwaho enjoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:2">Kub 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muteetomboita nka bamwe omuribo oku baayetomboitsire, bakamarwaho Omuhwerekyerezi. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ebyo bikabahikaho kuba eby'okureeberaho, kandi bikahandiikwa kutuhuguura, itwe abariho omu biro by'aha muheru gw'ensi. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo orikuteekateeka ngu ayemereire ayerinde atagwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Tihariho kigyezo ekirababaireho ekitari kya bantu boona. Kwonka Ruhanga n'ow'okwesigwa; taribaikiriza kugyezibwa kigyezo eki mutarikubaasa; kureka omu kigyezo ekyo aryabateeraho oburyo bw'okuhunga, ngu mubaase kukigumisiririza. <verse eid="1CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo, abarikukundwa, mwetantare, okuramya ebishushani. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nimbagambira nk'abantu abaine obwengye; mwetegyereze eki ndikugamba. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:27">Mat 26:27</ref>. </char></note> Okukwatana ekikopo ky'omugisha, eki tushabira omugisha, tikwo kukwatanisa omu shagama ya Kristo? Okubagana omugaati ogu tucwamu, tikwo kukwatanisa omu mubiri gwa Kristo? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:27">1 Kor 12:27</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku omugaati guri gumwe, nikwo naitwe, n'obu turi baingi, turi omubiri gumwe, ahabw'okuba twena tubagana omugaati gumwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Mureebe Abaisraeli omu buzaare bw'omubiri, abarya aha bitambo tibateeranwa eitambiro? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Mbwenu ngambe ki? Nti: Ekihongyeirwe ekishushani n'ekintu? Nari ekishushani kyo n'ekintu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:37">Zab 106:37</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eki ndikugamba n'eki nti: Abanyamahanga ebi batamba, babitambira baadaimoni, ti Ruhanga; kandi tindikwenda imwe kukwatanisa na baadaimoni. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:15">2 Kor 6:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 6:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:12">Mal 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Timurikubaasa kunywa ha kikopo kya Mukama, kandi n'aha kya baadaimoni. Timurikubaasa kuriira ha meeza ya Mukama waitu n'aha ya baadaimoni. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Mbwenu nitukwatsa Mukama waitu eihari? Nari shi nitumukiza amaani?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaine amaani okutagwisa abatagaine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:12">1 Kor 6:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Byona nibiikirizibwa, kwonka ti byona ebiine omugasho. Byona nibiikirizibwa, kwonka ti byona ebirikwombeka. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Omuntu weena arekye kwesherurira ebye ahabwe, kureka asherure eby'okuhwera mutaahi we. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Ekirikugurwa omu itundiro ry'enyama kyona mukirye, mutaine ki mubuurize ahabw'okwiha okubanganisa omu mutima; <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Zab 24:1</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ensi n'ebirimu byona n'ebya Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:8">Luk 10:8</ref>. </char></note> Omwe aha batarikwikiriza ku ariba yaabeetsire aha bugyenyi, mwasiima kuzayo, murye ebi babata omu maisho, mutaine ki mubuurize ahabw'okwiha okubanganisa omu mutima. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:7">1 Kor 8:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku harigira omuntu owaabagambira ati: Eki kitambiirwe baadaimoni, murekye kukirya ahabw'ogwo owaabamanyisa, n'ahabw'eiraka ry'omwoyo eriri omuriimwe; <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />(eiraka eri ndikugamba ti ryawe, n'ery'omuntu ogwo). Ahabw'enki obusingye bwangye nibucwerwa orubanja eiraka ry'omwoyo gw'ondiijo muntu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:4">1 Tim 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndaabe ndya n'okusiima, ahabw'enki njumwa ahabw'ekyo eki naasiimira? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:17">Kol 3:17</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ku muraabe nimurya nari nimunywa nari nimukora ekintu kyona, mukore byona okuhimbisisa Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:13">Rom 14:13</ref>. </char></note> Mutagwisa kubi Abayudaaya nari Abagriika nari ekanisa ya Ruhanga; <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />naanye nk'oku nteeraho kushemeza abantu boona omuri byona ebi nkora, ntarikusherura by'okungasira nyenka, kureka eby'okugasira baingi, ngu bajunwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abakristaayo oku bashemereire kutwaza omu nteerane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukuratire emitwarize yangye, nk'oku naanye nkuratira Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nimbasiima ahabw'okuunyijuka omuri byona, n'okugumizamu omu migyenzo nk'oku naagibeegyeise. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:16">Kut 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka niinyenda ngu imwe mumanye ku omutwe gw'omushaija ari Kristo, n'omutwe gw'omukazi ku ari iba, kandi omutwe gwa Kristo ku ari Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Omushaija weena orikushaba nari orikubuurira ayetwekyereire, naaba ahemwire omutwe gwe; <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />kwonka omukazi weena orikushaba nari orikubuurira ateetwekyereire, naaba ahemwire omutwe gwe; ahakuba ni nk'omweire enkomborora. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Omukazi ku araabe atarikwenda kwetwekyerera, bamutegye eishokye; kwonka ku kiraabe kiri eky'enshoni omukazi okusharwa eishokye nari okutegwa, ayeetwekyerere. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Mumanye ngu omushaija tashemereire kwetwekyerera, ahakuba n'ekishushani kya Ruhanga n'ekitiinisa kye; kwonka omukazi n'ekitiinisa ky'omushaija. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:13">1 Tim 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omushaija tarahangirwe kuruga omu mukazi, kureka omukazi niwe yaarugire omu mushaija. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18">Kut 2:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omushaija tarahangiirwe mukazi, kureka omukazi niwe yaahangiirwe omushaija. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo omukazi ashemereire kugira eky'okwetwekyerera ahabwa baamaraika. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Kwonka omuri Mukama omukazi tabaho hatari mushaija, n'omushaija tabaho hatari mukazi; <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />ahakuba nk'oku omukazi yaarugire omu mushaija, nikwo n'omushaija azaarwa omukazi; kandi byona biruga ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Naimwe mubiteekateekyeho. Ni kirungi omukazi kushaba Ruhanga ateetwekyereire? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nangwa n'emicwe y'obuntu tebeegyesa ngu omushaija okureka eishokye rye rikakura nikimuhemura? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Kwonka omukazi ku areka eishokye rye ryakura, kiba eky'ekitiinisa ahariwe; ahabw'okuba akaheebwa eishokye kumutwekyerera. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Kwonka ku haraabe hariho orikwenda kureeta empaka, amanye ngu omugyenzo nk'ogwo titugwine, kandi n'omu makanisa ga Ruhanga tigurimu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'Okuteerana okurikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Omu bi ndikwenda kubaragiira, tindikubasiima, ahakuba ku mweteerana, tiharugamu kugyenda mu maisho, kureka okugaruka enyima. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-12">1 Kor 1:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:3">3:3</ref>. </char></note> Eky'okubanza, nimpurira ngu, ku muba mweteeraine nk'ekanisa, habaho okutaikirizana omuriimwe, kandi ebimwe niinyikiriza ngu nikwo biri. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:19">1 Yoh 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:3">Bir 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu okutaana kushemereire kubaho omuriimwe, abarikusiimwa omuriimwe babone kureebwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ku muba muteeraine, ti kuba kurya By'okurya bya Mukama waitu; <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />ahakuba omu kurya okwo omuntu weena abanza kurya eby'okurya bye ahabwe, omwe aguma aine enjara, ondiijo asinzire. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:5">Yak 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 2:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Imwe! Timugira amaju g'okuriiramu n'okunyweramu? Nari mugaya ekanisa ya Ruhanga, mukwatsa enshoni abataine kantu? Mbagambire ki? Mbasiime ahabw'ekyo? Ngaaha, tindikubasiima. <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat 26:26-28</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba eki naahairwe Mukama, nikyo naabahaire naimwe, ngu Mukama waitu Yesu, aha kiro eki baamureebeizeho, akakwata omugaati; <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />ku yaaherize kusiima, yaagubega, yaagira ati: Ogu nigwo mubiri gwangye oguheebwayo ahabwanyu; mugume mukore muti okuunyijukiraho. <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kur 24:8</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kurya, yaakwata atyo n'ekikopo, yaagira ati: Ekikopo eki niyo ndagaano nsya omu shagama yangye. Mugume mukore muti, mwaba nimuginywa, okuunyijukiraho. <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ahakuba ku murya aha mugaati ogu, kandi mwanywa n'aha kikopo eki, muba nimworeka okufa kwa Mukama waitu, okuhitsya obu ariija.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 10:29">Heb 10:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu weena orikurya aha mugaati gwa Mukama waitu, akanywa aha kikopo kye nk'oku kitashemereire, aryagira orubaja rw'okucumura aha mubiri n'eshagama ebya Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:22">Mat 26:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:5">2 Kor 13:5</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu ayeshwijume, abone kurya aha mugaati ogwo n'okunywa aha kikopo ekyo. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ahakuba omuntu ku arya yaanywa, ateetaire ha mubiri gwa Mukama, aba naayeriira kandi naayenywera orubanja. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:6">1 Tes 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo kireeteire baingi omuriimwe kugira amagara mabi n'okurwara; kandi n'abagwejegyeire ti bakye. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Kuri twecwera orubanja twenka, titwakurucwereirwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:5">Heb 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 12:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nka ku turucwerwa Mukama waitu, atuhana ngu turekye kucwerwa orubanja hamwe n'ab'ensi.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, ku muraagume mwateerana kurya, mugume murindane, <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />(omuntu weena ku araabe aine enjara, arye omuka) murekye kweteerana mukeereetera orubanja. Ebindi ndyabibahabura naija.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiconco eby'Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Ebirikukwata aha biconco by'Omwoyo, B'eishe-emwe, tindikwenda ngu mutabimanya. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Nimumanya ngu, obu mwabaire mukiri abakafiiri, mukaba muhabisibwa muhabira omu bishushani ebitarikubaasa kugamba, nk'oku mwabaire muhabisibwa hoona. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:2">1 Yoh 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 4:3">3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo nimbamanyisa nti: Tihariho muntu ogambira omu Mwoyo wa Ruhanga owaakugira ati: Yesu akyeenwe; kandi tihariho owaakubaasa kugira ati: Yesu niwe Mukama, atagambisiibwe Mwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="1CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Rom 12:6</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu hariho ebiconco by'emiringo mingi, kwonka Omwoyo n'omwe; <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Efe 4:11</ref>. </char></note> hariho n'okuheereza kw'emiringo mingi, kwonka Mukama n'omwe; <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />kandi hariho okukora kw'emiringo mingi, kwonka Ruhanga okoresa byona omuri boona n'omwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Kandi buri muntu ashuuruurirwa eby'Omwoyo kugasira boona. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ahakuba omwe aheebwa Omwoyo ekigambo ky'obwengye, ondiijo aheebwa ekigambo ky'okwetegyereza omu buryo bw'Omwoyo ogwo; <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />ondiijo aheebwa Omwoyo ogwo okwikiriza, ondiijo aheebwa Omwoyo ogwo omwe ebiconco eby'okutamba endwara, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />ondiijo okukora eby'okutangaaza, ondiijo okubuurira, ondiijo obwengye obw'okutaanisa omu myoyo, ondiijo ekiconco “eky'okugamba endimi” ezitari zimwe, ondiijo eky'okushoboorora “endimi”. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Rom 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebyo byona bikorwa Omwoyo ogwo omwe, niwe agabira buri muntu, nk'oku ayenda.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Mumanye ngu, nk'oku omubiri guba gumwe, gukagira engingo nyingi, kandi engingo ezo zoona ez'omubiri, n'obu ziraabe ziri nyingi, guba omubiri gumwe; na Kristo nikwo ari. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omu Mwoyo omwe twena tukabatizibwa kuba omubiri gumwe, n'obu turaabe turi Abayudaaya nari Abagriika, abahuuku nari ab'obusingye; twena tukanyweisibwa aha Mwoyo omwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Ahakuba omubiri tiguba rugingo rumwe, kureka nyingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ekigyere ku kyakugira kiti: Obu ntari mukono, tindi rugingo rw'omubiri, ekyo tikikaakihindura kutaba ky'omubiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />N'okutu ku kwakugira kuti: Obu ntari riisho, tindi rugingo rw'omubiri, ekyo tikikaakuhindura kutaba kw'omubiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Omubiri gwona kuri gwabaire eriisho, gukaahuriire guta? Kandi kuri gwabaire okutu, gukaakagiise ki? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Kwonka Ruhanga akataho engingo zoona omu mubiri, buri rugingo nk'oku yaasiimire. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Engingo zoona kuri zaabaire orugingo rumwe, omubiri gukaabaire gurahi? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Kwonka, nk'oku kiri, engingo ni nyingi, kwonka omubiri ni gumwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Eriisho tiririkubaasa kugira omukono riti: Tonyiniire mugasho; nari shi omutwe kugira ebigyere guti: Timunyiniire mugasho. <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Nangwa n'ekindi, engingo z'omubiri ezi tuteekateekaho ngu tiziine maani, nizo ziba ezirikwetengwa; <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />n'engingo z'omubiri ezi tuteekateekaho ngu tiziine kitiinisa, nizo tuha ekitiinisa okukira ezindi; kandi engingo zaitu eziitsa enshoni nizo tujwarira, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />kwonka ezitaitsa nshoni tizeetenga kujwekwa. Nikwo Ruhanga yaateeraine omubiri, orugingo orutaine kitiinisa yaaba nirwo yaaha ekitiinisa okukira ezindi, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />ngu omu mubiri harekye kubamu okutaikirizana, kureka engingo zoona zisaasibwane. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Orugingo rumwe ku rushaasha, engingo zoona zisaasira hamwe; orugingo rumwe ku ruheebwa ekitiinisa, engingo zoona zishemerererwa hamwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Mbwenu naimwe muri omubiri gwa Kristo, kandi n'engingo zaagwo buri omwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Kandi Ruhanga akataho abantu omu kanisa, ab'okubanza entumwa, aba kabiri baanabi, aba kashatu abeegyesa, bwanyima abakora eby'okutangaaza; bwanyima yaataho ab'okutamba endwara, n'abahwezi, n'abategyeki, n'ab'okugamba “endimi” zitari zimwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Nimugira ngu boona n'entumwa? Boona ni baanabi? Boona n'abeegyesa? Boona bakora eby'okutangaaza? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Boona baine ekiconco eky'okutamba endwara? Boona bagamba “endimi”? Boona bazishoboorora? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Kwonka mute omutima aha kusherura ebiconco ebirikukira oburungi. Kandi niinyija kubooreka omuhanda ogurikukira oburungi.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Oku okukunda kukira ebindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />N'obu naakugamba endimi z'abantu n'eza baamaraika, kwonka ntaine kukunda, nkaaba ndi nk'omuringa ogurikurangira n'ekyoma ekirikugamba. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:22">Mat 7:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'obu naakugira ekiconco eky'obunabi, nkamanya enaama zoona n'obwengye bwona, kandi n'obu naakugira okwikiriza kwona, okwakumbaasisa kwihaho enshozi, kwonka ntaine kukunda, nkaaba ntari kintu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Kandi n'obu naakugaba ebintu byangye byona kuriisa abooro, kandi n'obu naakuhayo omubiri gwangye kwokibwa, kwonka ntaine kukunda, tikiine ki kyakungasira.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Okukunda kugumisiriza, kugira embabazi; okukunda tikugira ihari; okukunda tikwehimbisa, tikwetunguura; <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:4">Fil 2:4</ref>. </char></note> tikukora birikwitsa enshoni, tikwesherurira byakwo; tikurahuka kuguubwa kubi, tikuteekateeka kibi aha muntu; <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />tikushemerererwa kutahikiirira, kureka kushemerererwa amazima. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:12">1 Kor 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Okukunda kwemera byona, kwikiriza byona, kugira amatsiko ahari byona, kugumisiririza byona.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1 Pet 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okukunda tikuhwaho ebiro byona; obunabi bwo buryaihwaho, okugamba “endimi” kuryahwaho; n'obwengye buryaihwaho; <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />ahakuba nitumanyaho kakye; nituragura kakye; <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />kwonka ebihikire ku biriija, ebitahikire biryaihwaho. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Obu naabaire ndi muto, nkaba ngamba nk'omuto, nyetegyereza nk'omuto, nteekateeka nk'omuto; ku naakuzire, naareka eby'obuto. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:7">2 Kor 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu hati nitureebera omu ndeeberwamu tutarikuhweza gye; kwonka omu biro ebyo turyareebana butunu. Hati nimmanyaho kakye; kwonka omu biro ebyo ndyamanyira kimwe nk'oku naamanyiirwe kimwe. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">1 Tes 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ebirikugumaho ni bishatu, okwikiriza, amatsiko n'okukunda; kwonka ekirikukira byona n'okukunda.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Oku okubuurira kukira okugamba “endimi”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:10">1 Kor 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwezirikire okukunda; kandi mwetengyere kimwe ebiconco by'Omwoyo, kwonka okukira mwetengye okubuurira. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Orikugamba “orurimi” naaba atarikugambira bantu, kureka Ruhanga; ahabw'okuba tihaine orikubishoborokyerwa; kwonka we Omwoyo naaba naamugambisa enaama. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Kwonka orikubuurira naaba naagambira abantu eby'okubombeka n'okubeezirikisa n'okubahuumuriza. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Orikugamba “orurimi” naaba naayeyombeka wenka; kwonka orikubuurira naaba naayombeka ekanisa. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:29">Kub 11:29</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu niinyenda ku mwena mugamba “endimi”, kwonka okukira ku mubuurira. Ahakuba obuurira akira ogamba “endimi”, kureka haagira owaazishoboorora, ngu ekanisa ebone kwombekwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, ku ndiija owaanyu ningamba “endimi”, ndyabagasira ki, ku ndiba ntagambire ki naashuuruurirwa, nari eky'okumanya, nari eky'okubuurira, nari eky'okubeegyesa? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Nangwa n'ebintu ebigamba, ebitaine magara, nk'emikuri nari enanga, ku birikuba bitataaniise maraka gaabyo, baryamanya bata eki birikugamba? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Enzamba ku egamba eiraka eritarikwetegyerezibwa, n'oha oyeteekateeka kuza aha rugamba? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Mbwenu imwe, ku muraabe mutarikugamba mu “ndimi” ebigambo ebirikushobooroka, baryamanya bata ebirikugambwa? Ahakuba muryaba nimushusha nk'abarikugambira omuyaga. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Omu nsi yoona n'obu harimu endimi nyingi zita, tihariho na rumwe orutaine oku rushoboororwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Ku mba ntashoborokyeirwe rurimi, mba nk'omunyamahanga ahari ogwo orikugamba, nawe ambeera atyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Naimwe nk'oku mwine obweziriki aha biconco by'Omwoyo, mweshumbyeho okwezirika kwombeka ekanisa.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />N'ahabw'ekyo orikugamba “orurimi”, ashabe kuheebwa okurushoboorora. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ahakuba ku mba ninshaba omu “rurimi”, omwoyo gwangye gushaba, kwonka obwengye bwangye tibugira ki bukora. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Efe 5:19</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ngire nta? Niinyija kushabisa Omwoyo, kandi nshabise n'obwengye; niinyija kweshongoza Omwoyo, kandi nyenshongoze n'obwengye. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ku oriba otatwarize otyo, haza waashabira omugisha omu Mwoyo wenka, omuntu ori aha rubaju rw'abatarikwetegyereza, aryaikiriza ata ati: Amiina, waaheza kusiima, haza we ataamanya ki waagamba? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />N'amazima, ahabwawe nooba osiimire gye: kwonka ogwo we tarikuhwerwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ninsiima Ruhanga, ahakuba mwena nimbakiza kugamba “endimi”; <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />kwonka omu kanisa omu mwanya gw'okugamba ebigambo kakumi “omu rurimi”, nkaayenzire kugamba ebigambo bitaano n'obwengye bwangye, ngu nyegyese abandi.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:14">Efe 4:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, mutaba abaana bato omu bwengye; kureka omu bibi mube abeereere, kwonka omu bwengye mube bakuru. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11">Isa 28:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 28:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Omu Biragiro kikahandiikwa ngu: ndyagamba n'eihanga eri omu kanwa k'abantu abarikugamba endimi ezindi n'omu kanwa k'abanyamahanga; kwonka, n'obu ndigamba ntyo, tibarimpurira, nikwo Mukama arikugira. <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo “endimi” n'akamanyiso aha batarikwikiriza, ti ha barikwikiriza; kwonka okubuurira n'akamanyiso aha barikwikiriza, ti ha batarikwikiriza. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Ekanisa yoona ku yaakuba eteeraine, boona baagamba “endimi”, ku haakutaahamu abatarikushoborokyerwa nari abatarikwikiriza? Tibakaagira ngu mugwire eiraro? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:13">Byak 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka boona ku baakuba nibabuurira, kandi omuntu otarikwikiriza nari otarikushoborokyerwa ku yaakutaahamu, akaahanwa boona, kandi acwerwa boona orubanja; <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:14">Isa 45:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:23">Zek 8:23</ref>. </char></note> enaama z'omu mutima gwe zishuuruurwa, abona kujuumara ahansi n'okuramya Ruhanga naahamya ati: Buzima kwo Ruhanga ari omuriimwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, biri bita? Ku muteerana, buri muntu areeta ekye, omwe areeta zaaburi, ondiijo eky'okwegyesa, ondiijo eki ashuuruuriirwe, ondiijo “orurimi”, n'ondiijo eky'okushoboorora. Byona bigume bikorwe ahabw'okwombeka abantu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ku haraabe haabaireho abarikugamba “endimi”, hagambe babiri, kutarenga ahari bashatu, kandi bagambe omu mbu; habeho n'ow'okubishoboorora. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Kwonka ku haraabe hatariho ow'okushoboorora, orikugamba “orurimi” ahuname omu kanisa, abigambe n'omutima gwe, kandi abigambire Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:21">1 Tes 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ababuurizi bagambe babiri nari bashatu, abandi babyetegyereze. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Kwonka ku haraabe hariho oshutami, yaashuuruurirwa ekigambo, owaaba naagamba ahuname. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ahakuba mwena nimubaasa kubuurira omwe omwe, ngu boona babone kwega, n'okwezirikisana. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Emyoyo ya baanabi etegyekwa baanabi; <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />ahakuba Ruhanga ti Ruhanga w'okujagarara, kureka n'ow'obusingye.<verse eid="1CO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 2:5">Tit 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:12">1 Tim 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku biri omu makanisa goona ag'abarikwera, abakazi bahuname omu makanisa; ahakuba tibarikwikirizibwa kugamba, kureka okworoba, nk'oku Ebiragiro nabyo biragiira. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Kandi baaba nibenda kushoborokyerwa ekigambo, bakibuurize abashaija baabo omuka, ahabw'okuba n'eky'enshoni omukazi kugamba omu kanisa. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Mbwenu, nimugira ngu niimwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga kyakomookiremu? Nari niimwe mwenka abu kyaiziire?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:6">1 Yoh 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena orikweteekateekaho ngu ni nabi, nari ow'Omwoyo, amanye ngu eki mbahandiikiire n'ekiragiro kya Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Kandi weena otarikukiikiriza tarikwikirizibwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />N'ahabw'ekyo, Beene Tata, mwetengye munonga okubuurira, kandi mutazibira okugamba “endimi”; <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:5">Kol 2:5</ref>. </char></note> kwonka byona bikorwe gye, bitebeekanisiibwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuzooka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />B'eishe-emwe, ningaruka kubamanyisa engiri, ei naababuuriire, mukaikiriza, kandi ei muhamiiremu, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />niyo erikubajuna, ku muraabe nimugigumya, nk'oku naagibabuuriire, kureka okwikiriza kwanyu kube kwabaire kuri okwa busha. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:8">Isa 53:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 53:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu ekikuru eki naabandize kubaha, eki naahairwe, n'eki ngu, Kristo akafa ahabw'ebibi byaitu, nk'oku Ebyahandiikirwe bigira, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Yon 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Zab 16:10</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu akaziikwa, yaazooka aha izooba rya kashatu, nk'oku Ebyahandiikirwe bigira, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />yaayeyoreka Keefa, bwanyima yaayeyoreka eikumi na babiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Kandi bwanyima yaayeyorekyera hamwe ab'eishe-emwe okukira ahari magana ataano; abaingi aharibo bakiriho na hati, n'obu abamwe baraabe bagwejegyeire. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Bwanyima yaayeyoreka Yakobo, na bwanyima entumwa zoona. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:1">1 Kor 9:1</ref>. </char></note> Aha muheru gwa boona naanye yaanyeyoreka ndi nk'omwana orengize amazaariro. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:8">Efe 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:15">1 Tim 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ndi muto aha ntumwa ezindi, otashemereire kwetwa ntumwa, ahabw'okuba nkahiiga ekanisa ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:5">2 Kor 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 11:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ahabw'embabazi za Ruhanda ndi nk'oku ndi; kandi embabazi ze ahariinye tizirabaire za busha, ahakuba nkakora munonga okukira entumwa zoona, kwonka tiinye, kureka embabazi za Ruhanga ezaabaire zimpwera. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Mbwenu yaaba nyowe, nari ezo ntumwa, okwo nikwo tubuurira, kandi nikwo mwaikiriize.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Mbwenu Kristo ku araabe naagambwa ngu akazooka omu bafu, abamwe omuriimwe nibahamya bata ngu tihariho kuzooka kw'abafu? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ku haraabe hatariho kuzooka kw'abafu, na Kristo tarazookire. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Kandi Kristo ku araabe atarazoirwe, biri okubuurira kwaitu n'okwa busha, n'okwikiriza kwanyu nakwo n'okwa busha. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Nangwa naitwe nituba tuhindukire baakareebi ba Ruhanga ab'ebishuba, ahabw'okuba tukahamya ngu Ruhanga akazoora Kristo, ou atarazoire, ku kiraabe kiri eky'amazima ngu abafu tibazooka. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:14">1 Kor 6:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba abafu, ku baraabe batazooka, na Kristo tarazoirwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Kandi Kristo ku araabe atarazoirwe, okwikiriza kwanyu n'okwa busha; nimuba mukiri omu bibi byanyu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Kandi n'abo abaagwejegyereire omuri Kristo nibaba bacwekyereire. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ku turaabe twine amatsiko omuri Kristo omu biro by'amagara aga gonka, nituba turi ab'okusaasirwa okukira abandi boona.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omu mazima Kristo akazoorwa omu bafu, niwe muganuro gw'abagwejegyeire. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Kut 3:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:12">Rom 5:12</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 5:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nk'oku okufa kwareetsirwe omuntu, nikwo n'okuzooka kw'abafu kwareetsirwe omuntu. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Nk'oku boona bafa omuri Adamu, nikwo n'omuri Kristo boona barihindurwa abahuriire. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:16">1 Tes 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:5">Kush 20:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka buri muntu omu rubu rwe, Kristo niwe muganuro; bwanyima hakurateho abe ku ariija. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>. </char></note> Ku ariheza kukwatsa Ruhanga Isheboona obukama, yaaheza kumaraho obutegyeki bwona n'obushoboorizi bwona n'amaani goona, obwo emperu eryahika. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ashemereire kutegyeka okuhitsya obu arita abazigu be boona ahansi y'ebigyere bye. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:14">Kush 20:14</ref>. </char></note> Omuzigu orihereeruka kwihwaho ni rufu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu; Akamuha kutegyeka byona, abitaire ahansi y'ebigyere bye. Kwonka, ku kiraabe nikigira kityo, ngu byona bitairwe omu butegyeki bwe, nikimanywa ngu Ogwo owaamuhaire kutegyeka byona tabirimu. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Kandi ebintu byona ku biriheza kuteebwa omu butegyeki bwe, obwo Omwana nawe aryateebwa omu butegyeki bw'Ogwo owaataire byona ahansi ye, Ruhanga abone kuba byona ahari boona.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ku kiraabe kitari kityo, ababatizibwa ahabw'abaafiire baryaba bata? Abafiire ku baraabe batazooka buzima, n'enki ekibabatirisa ahabw'abaafiire? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:36">Rom 8:36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ahabw'enki tweta omu kabi buri kaanya? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:10">2 Kor 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 4:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Nindahira nti, buri izooba mba ow'okufa, nimbirahira ahabw'okwehimbisa oku nyine ahabwanyu, B'eishe-emwe, omuri Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa 22:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndaabe naarwaine n'enyamaishwa omuri Efeso omu muringo gw'abantu, nkaagasirwa ki? Abafu ku baraabe batazooka, reka tweriire, twenywere, ahakuba nyencakare turi ab'okufa. <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Mutabeihwabeihwa; ekigombe kibi kishiisha emicwe mirungi. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Musinduukye, mube abahikiriire, murekye kushiisha; ahakuba abamwe tibarikumanya Ruhanga. Ebi naabigamba kubakwatsa enshoni.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Shana omwe akaabuuza ati: Abafu bazoorwa bata? Kandi baryazooka na mubiri ki? <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:24">Yoh 12:24</ref>. </char></note> Iwe mushema 'we, embibo ei obiba temera kureka yaaheza kufa. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Kandi n'ei obyara tobyara mubiri ogu erigira, kureka enjuma kwonka, yaaba y'engano nari ey'enjuma ezindi. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:11">Kut 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga agiha omubiri, nk'oku akunda, kandi buri njuma agiha omubiri ogwayo yonka. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Nimumanya ngu emibiri yoona teshushana; hariho omuringo gumwe ogw'abantu, ogundi gw'enyamaishwa, ogundi gw'enyonyi, n'ogundi ogw'eby'enyanja. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Hariho eby'omu iguru, kandi n'eby'omu nsi; kwonka ekitiinisa ky'eby'omu iguru kiri okwakyo, n'ekitiinisa ky'eby'omu nsi nakyo kiri okwakyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Hariho ekitiinisa ky'eizooba, n'eky'okwezi, n'ekindi ky'enyonyoozi; kandi enyonyoozi nazo zikizakizana ekitiinisa.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />N'okuzooka kw'abafu nikwo kuri. Omubiri gubibwa guri ogw'okujunda, guzoorwa guri ogw'okutajunda. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:20">Fil 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 3:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Gubibwa gutaine kitiinisa, guzoorwa gwine ekitiinisa. Gubibwa gutaine maani, guzoorwa gwine amaani. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Gubibwa guri omubiri gw'obuntu, guzoorwa guri ogw'omwoyo. Ku haraabe hariho omubiri gw'obuntu, hariho n'ogw'omwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:21">Yoh 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi kikahandiikwa ngu: Omuntu ow'okubanza, Adamu, akahinduka omuntu oine amagara; Adamu owa bwanyima yaahinduka Omwoyo orikureeta amagara. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Kwonka Ow'omwoyo tiwe yaabandize, kureka ow'omubiri ogw'obuntu, bwanyima haakurataho Ow'omwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ow'okubanza akaruga omu itaka, n'omuntu w'omucuucu; Omuntu owa kabiri akaruga omu iguru. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Nk'ow'omu itaka oku yaabaire ari, nikwo n'ab'omu itaka bari; kandi nk'Ow'omu iguru oku ari, n'ab'omu iguru nikwo bari, <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kandi nk'oku twashushaine n'ow'omu itaka, nikwo turishushana n'Ow'omu iguru. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, eki ndikugamba nikyo eki nti: Omubiri n'eshagama tibirikubaasa kuhungura bukama bwa Ruhanga, kandi n'ebijunda tibirihungura butajunda.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1 Tes 4:15-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nimbaatira enaama nti: Twena titurigwejegyera, kwonka twena turyahindurwa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mat 24:31</ref>. </char></note> omu kaanya kakye, nk'ak'okuhumbya eriisho, aha nzamba ey'aha mperu. Ahakuba enzamba eryagamba, kandi abaafiire baryazoorwa obutagaruka kujunda, naitwe turyahindurwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:4">2 Kor 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu omubiri ogu ogujunda gushemereire kujwara okutajunda, kandi omubiri ogu ogufa gushemereire kujwara okutafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ogujunda ogu kandi n'ogufa ogu ku guriba gwajwaire okutafa, obwo ekigambo ekyahandiikirwe kiryahikiirira ekirikugira kiti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:54">Okufa kumiziirwe okusingura.<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Rufu, okusingura kwawe kurahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Iwe Rufu, oruburi rwawe rurahi?<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:56: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:13">Rom 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:14">6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oruburi rwa rufu n'ekibi, kandi n'amaani g'ekibi n'Ebiragiro. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Kwonka Ruhanga asiimwe, otuha okusingura ahabwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:58: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 15:7">2 Bus 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:13">Kush 14:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, beene Tata abarikukundwa, muhame, murekye kunyiganyigibwa, mweyongyere obutoosha kukora omurimo gwa Mukama, ahabw'okuba nimumanya ngu okukora kwanyu ti kwa busha omuri Mukama.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuhwera abarikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:29">Byak 11:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikukwata aha kuteeranira abarikwera empiiha, nk'oku naaragiire amakanisa ag'omuri Galatia, naimwe mube nikwo mwagira. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Aha kiro ky'okubanza omu saabiiti, buri muntu omuriimwe agume abiikye omu ka ye ebi arikubaasa aha bi atungire, ku ndiba naizire, harekye kubaho okuteerana empiiha. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ku ndihika okwo, abu muriha ebaruha z'okubasiima, nibo ndyohereza kutwara ebiconco byanyu Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Kandi naanye ku kiriba kinshemereire kugyenda, turyagyendana.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enaama za Paulo n'okuramutsya kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Byak 19:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ndyabataayaayira ninduga Makedeonia; ahabw'okuba ndyarabayo; <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />kandi shana ndyaguma naimwe, obundi nkaamarirayo n'ebiro by'embeho, mubone kunshendekyereza ahi ndiza hoona. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ahakuba tindikwenda kubarabyaho amaguru hati; ahabw'okuba nyine amatsiko g'okumara naimwe ebiro, Mukama ku arikunda. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Kwonka ndyaguma omuri Efeso okuhitysa aha kiro kya Pentekoote; <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:12">2 Kor 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:8">Kush 3:8</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba nyiguriirwe orwigi ruhango kuza omu mirimo ey'omugasho; kwonka abarikundwanisa ni baingi.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:17">1 Kor 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:20">Fil 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Timoseo ku ariija owaanyu, mumwakiire abone kuguma naimwe ataine bwoba, ahakuba naakora omurimo gwa Mukama nkaanye; <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:12">1 Tim 4:12</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo hatarigira owaamugaya; mumushendekyereze n'obusingye, abone kugaruka ahi ndi; ahabw'okuba mmutegyereize kwija hamwe n'ab'eishe-emwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:12">1 Kor 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:6">3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'ow'eishe-emwe Apolo nkamweshengyereza munonga kubataayaayira n'ab'eishe-emwe; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: kwonka tiyaayendera kimwe kwija hati. </char></note>kwonka Ruhanga tasiimire ku aija hati; kureka aryaija yaabona omwanya.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:10">Efe 6:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugume nimureeba, muhamire omu kwikiriza, murwane mashaija, mugume n'amaani. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Byona ebi murikukora, mubikorese rukundo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:16">1 Kor 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi, B'eishe-emwe, nimumanya ab'omu ka ya Stefana, ku nibo baabandize kuhinduka omuri Akaya, bakeehayo kuheereza abarikwera. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:29">Fil 2:29</ref>. </char></note> Nimbeehanangiriza kworobera abari nk'abo, n'ondiijo weena orikukwatanisa n'abandi omu mirimo n'obweziriki. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Kandi nyine okushemererwa ahabw'okwija kwa Stefana na Forutunaato na Akaiko; ahabw'okuba bammazire orushusho oru naabaire mbainiire; <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:12">1 Tes 5:12</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba bakaruhuura omwoyo gwangye n'ogwanyu. N'ahabw'ekyo abari nk'abo mubamanye. <verse eid="1CO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Amakanisa g'omuri Asia gabaramutsya. Akula na Pruskila n'ekanisa eteeranira omu ka yaabo baabaramutsya munonga omuri Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Ab'eishe-emwe boona baabaramutsya. Muramukanise okunywegyerana okurikwera.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 3:17">2 Tes 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo kuramutsya kwangye, Paulo, oku naahandiika n'omukono gwangye nyenka. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:8">Gal 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 1:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ku haraabe hariho omuntu otarikukunda Mukama, akyeenwe. Mukama waitu naija. <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Embabazi zigume naimwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Okukunda kwangye kugume naimwe mwena omuri Kristo Yesu. Amiina.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>